00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.510 align:start position:0%
 
people of the internet it's been another  week and another bit of news for  hogwarts legacy fans this week it comes  to us in the form of a tweet shared by  the official avalanche wb twitter  account just to be clear this is 100  official and was also shared by  community manager chandler wood as well  now there were two big things shown off  in this footage one clothing for our  character and also what appears to be  goblin armor then they gave us a few  more hints by showing several different  variations of the character creator and  boy let me tell you the level of detail  in this guys is incredible now one of  the first things i did was grab  screenshots of each one of these  different shots and shared on my twitter  page here the quality isn't that great i  think because just twitter compression  when they share videos isn't all that  great so you do lose out on some of that  detail but it at least gives you a quick  snapshot view of each item now i will  tell you guys straight up i am not a  clothing expert so very likely that i  will get the technical name on some of  this wrong but i think what we have here  in this first one is a waistcoat and  then a jacket on the outside here also  has what appears to be either a floral  or maybe some sort of star pattern here  but the most striking thing about this  one to me is this little emblem here in  the top left of the screen i guess it  would be on the top right of the jacket  here but it appears to be some sort of  symbol it looks to me like an o with  maybe a wand through it and i mean the  only thing i can think of is it bears a  striking resemblance to some of the  logos that we have seen for ollivanders  over the years in fact if you take a  look at the wizarding world of harry  potter right here in orlando it looks  very very close to this logo right here  now clothing at ollivanders i don't  believe that is something that is canon  or something that we've ever seen before  so i don't think we should just  immediately take this as fact and say oh  they got these clothes from ollivanders  instead i think we should be asking  ourselves hey what that potential logo  and or pendant is and then also why it's  there now i'm gonna have to go back  through the trailer and see if there's  any time when we can see this on the  main character as well but you guys may  already know if you do let me know in  the comments below and we may perhaps  talk about it in another video if we  move on to the next one here this bit of  clothing appears to be inspired by  mexican cultures and the thing that  jumped out to me quickly on this one is  if you look closely at this waistcoat  here and i think what you see here is a  couple of different skull designs in  this pattern here you see one here one  here one here one here and then just a  couple more smaller ones kind of  scattered throughout there's also the  pendant here right at the top in the  very center and i know this thing has a  technical name but it is just escaping  me right now i cannot think of the  actual name of it oh wait is it a bolo  tie i think it's a bolo tie and then we  have the shirt with the high collar here  and this looks to me like a silk  material again guys i am totally out of  my element when it comes to clothing i  could be totally wrong on all this but i  think the most striking thing about both  of these here is just the level of  detail here that we have seen in both  these so far and trust me that's going  to be a theme throughout all of these  moving on to the next one here and now  we have two different sets of goblin  armor one of these has the hands and  wrist area completely covered you see  the one on the right here also has a  hood this one to me looks more like  maybe like a magic type goblin a mage of  some sort whereas i could see the one  with the full helm and kind of the  shoulder pads over here being a more  battle type mage and i know we see both  of these in the trailer i'm almost  positive we see them in the gameplay  trailer and this is just a much closer  look at that in terms of any pendants or  designs that we see here we have the  belt buckle in the very center which  seems to be some sort of spiral pattern  again i'm almost positive that we see  that in the trailer somewhere and then  also at the top of the hood we have this  other little design pattern as well so i  don't know if these mean anything if  they're connected to anything specific  or it's more of just the pattern they're  using for the goblin designs in the game  and then the next one is an up close  look at both the gauntlets and the  shoulder pad area they're just showing  the level of detail that is going into  this armor guys now i got to be  completely honest i always expected  hogwarts legacy to be a good game to be  an engaging game to be a game that would  police the fans but i don't know that i  fully expected the level of graphical  fidelity that we're seeing here because  everything we have seen so far just  looks fantastic i know in the trailers  we had those characters in the  background who their faces kind of  didn't look quite right yet but seeing  the level of detail of things like this  right here gives me more confidence that  they're going to have all that ironed  out by the time of the game's release  now i don't know that every single  character we come across is going to  have level of detail like this but the  fact that this right here i mean this is  on all the goblin armor in the game you  would assume that to me is a great sign  from there we move into shots that show  off the character creation process and  there's just so much to say about these  guys i mean the level of detail again i  just keep coming to that word detail i'm  just gonna let these scroll through here  for a bit and i want you to take a look  at the variations in the skin tone on  all these different characters then take  a look at the little imperfections that  we see in the skin you see little  freckles you see moles you see blemishes  the different eyebrows and all the hair  options they just look so good and so  incredibly realistic by the way i can't  tell you how disappointed i was when i  realized that because these characters  are 15 there's probably very little  chance of us having beards in this game  so i guess when i make my character in  hogwarts legacy i'm gonna have to make  them a younger version of me with more  hair on top of the head less hair on the  face now after seeing all this you could  be wondering well how does this actually  look in game well they actually just  confirmed that robe physics are  officially in the game they weren't  removed and i break that down in the  video on the right side of your screen  now if you're new here and you want to  stay up to date on all the hogwarts  legacy news theories and discussion then  make sure you hit that subscribe button  before you go as always thank you all so  much for watching i'll talk to you again  soon

